2|0@bestofworldstar^1438546486#ctp60lu:martyrfx$:That's weird.. They should allow you to go to the food court. Another trick is to say you're going to the pharmacy, since you don't need a membership to use their pharmacy, but keep in mind they can kick you out any time lol. Costco is the best out there imo. Sam's is in second place, but they suck. My dad has membership to both and I find the products at Costco are higher quality and better, but they do have a lot of items that are the same. Another thing I've noticed is the people that shop at both places are slightly similar, but Costco seems to have more people that are higher class. 
