2|0@bestofworldstar^1438554823#ctpahnj:Domerhead$:As long as your friend is the one that's buying the stuff, I don't think they'll raise a stink about you being there. That being said, the membership is only $110 for a year, I split it with my brother (we can be on the same account), and shit is just so cheap there. They have a bomb ass bakery, and their booze selection is amazing (at least in Louisiana it is). I've made the membership money back by buying my booze there as opposed to buying it at a normal grocery store. They sell this huge handle of vodka that's essentially Grey Goose but rebranded as Kirkland, and it tastes great. Also buying TP and paper towels in bulk has been kind of nice. I haven't had to buy garbage bags, or ziploc bags in over a year now.
